Career Growth Opportunities

Do you have ambition, a desire to learn, and a vision for your future? Then this role is a great fit. We offer clear growth paths toward positions such as Line Lead, Assistant Supervisor, or Supervisor. There is also the opportunity to transition into a direct contract with Arvato.

Apply Now

Interested in joining the team? Click the apply button, and we’ll get in touch as soon as possible to explore the possibilities together!

Requirements:

- Experience with a hand scanner is a plus;

- Good command of English (speaking, reading, and writing);

- Able to provide a Certificate of Conduct (VOG);

- Experience in logistics is a plus but not a requirement;

- Own accommodation is required;

